        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Vectorize a Generated Logo\n\nGenerates a flat logo mark and traces it into vector art. Image generators only produce pixels, so drawing and tracing are separate steps.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Prompt\" describes a two-color fox head logo. \"2 Draw the mark\" generates a square image from it, \"3 Trace to SVG\" converts that image into vector paths, and \"4 SVG out\" returns the SVG.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"2 Draw the mark\" and rewrite \"1 Prompt\" for your own mark, keeping the flat colors and solid background."
        },
